+/*!
+ * \file  tests/Utilities/TrivialGenTypeBaseTest.cxx
+ * \brief This file tests the `TrivialGenTypeBase` class.
+ * \date  05/10/2026
+ * \copyright Copyright (C) 2006-2025 CEA/DEN, EDF R&D. All rights
+ * reserved.
